OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786286897
OL,3,CBody found in search for boy who went
OL,4,Cmissing in sea
OL,6,FRescuers searching for a teenage boy
OL,7,Fwho went missing off the East
OL,8,FYorkshire coast have found a body.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FSouth Promenade, Hornsea, after the 13-
OL,12,Fyear-old got into difficulty while
OL,13,Fswimming at about 6pm on Tuesday.
OL,15,FOn Wednesday morning Humberside Police
OL,16,Fconfirmed a body had been recovered at
OL,17,Fabout 4.30am.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/3
