PN,33902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786286897
OL,3,CBody found in search for boy who went
OL,4,Cmissing in sea
OL,6,FFormal identification has not yet
OL,7,Ftaken place, but the boy's family have
OL,8,Fbeen informed and are being supported
OL,9,Fby specialist officers.
OL,11,FCh Supt Phil Booker said: "This is an
OL,12,Fincredibly heartbreaking outcome, and
OL,13,Four thoughts are with the boy's family
OL,14,Fand friends at this devastating time."
OL,16,FStaff from HM Coastguard, Yorkshire
OL,17,FAmbulance Service and Humberside Fire
OL,18,Fand Rescue Services as well as
OL,19,FHumberside Police, were all involved
OL,20,Fin the search, along with a marine
OL,21,Funit and drone pilots.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/3
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
