OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786286897
OL,3,CBody found in search for boy who went
OL,4,Cmissing in sea
OL,6,FMr Booker added: "We know the sadness
OL,7,Fand concern this will cause in the
OL,8,Fcommunity, and we would ask that the
OL,9,Ffamily's privacy is respected during
OL,10,Fthis incredibly difficult time.
OL,12,F"I would like to thank all of the
OL,13,Femergency services involved in the
OL,14,Fsearch, along with members of the
OL,15,Fpublic for their support and
OL,16,Fcooperation."
